#: ../../source/docs/instruction/Hardware_connection.rst:4
#: 956bc745fc254b63acfc32a6c5a3de51
msgid "本文档主要介绍下载和烧录固件、发送 AT 命令和接收 AT 响应所需要的硬件以及硬件之间该如何连接。"
msgstr ""
"This document describes the hardware required for downloading and flashing "
"firmware, sending AT commands, and receiving AT responses, as well as how to "
"connect the hardware."

#: ../../source/docs/instruction/Hardware_connection.rst:6
#: 74cdbe30489e4211ad22626b0acfb617
msgid "对于不同系列的模组，AT 默认固件所支持的命令会有所差异。具体可参考 :doc:`other/firmware_differences`"
msgstr ""
"Supported commands may vary across module series in the default AT "
"firmware. See :doc:`other/firmware_differences` for details."

